MA
hi hello cook cooking~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+W'Well met $N! Feedin' the Tribe is no small task!'

In several quick thwacks, $n chops a tentacle into several
sections and continues &+W'Fish? They'll eat it if it's in front
&+Wof 'em, but what the Tribe is starvin for is land meat!'

&+W'Go &+Wfishing&+W, will ye? Catch two &+Wfish&+W and bring 'em back to me
&+Wand we'll have us &+Wfish skewers&+W, aye?!

&+WOr if ye come across a &+Whaunch of land meat&+W, maybe an &+Yolyx&+W,&+Y lion&+W,
&+Ytheezak&+W, &+Ycaribou&+W, or even just a plain &+Yside of boar&+W, I'd pay ye!'
~
MA
fishing fish skewer skewers~
&n$n nods hungrily at $N and says:
&+W'Bring us back two fish for a skewer, but if they're the same type
&+Wof fish, I always find they come out a bit sizzlier!'&n he says.
~
MA
meat landmeat land theezak olyx lion caribou~
