hi hello~
&N$n grunts at $N &+Y'Welcome aboard, thank ye for buyin' a
&+Yticket! The Ironhold Grudge will take ye where ye need to be!'

&N$n sighs and continues &+Y'The seas ain't a safe place no morem.
&+YFor ye see, $N, there be rivals..'
~
MA
seas rivals~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+Y'Best ye wary of the Stalval and the Fulgur.
&+YThey're happy to take yer gold, but ye might end up as fish food
&+Yif ye set sail with them!' &+YKur&+Cg&+Yo&+Cnn &Nspits on the floor.

&+Y'Bring me back the &+Cflags&+Y of the Stalval and the Crimson Fulgur,
&+Yand the seas will be safer for everyone, especially the Grudge
&+Yand her coffers!' &Nhe guffaws along with his &+Ca&+cdviso&+Cr&N.
~
QA
&+YKur&+Cg&+Yo&+Cnn&N gasps and says &+Y'Saints be praised, ye did it!'
Almost immediately, he begins unfurling the great flags and inspecting
them, along with his advisors.

&+YKur&+Cg&+Yo&+Cnn&N says &+Y'By law of the the Ironhold Grudge and in the
&+Yholy eyes of Abbathor, I award ye this ..uhh..'&N he fidgets and quickly
slides an &+cold ring&N off his pinky finger. &+Y'This ring!'&N he says.
~
