hi hello cook cooking~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+Y'Well met $N! Keepin' their bellies
&+Yfull be just as much work as climbin' the ropes or mannin' the
&+Yballist's!'

In several quick thwacks, $n chops a tentacle into several
sections and continues &+Y'Fish? They'll eat it if it's in front
&+Yof 'em, but these sailors be droolin' for land meat! I'm nay
&+Yopposed to fish meself, raised on the sea!' &n$n nods proudly.

&+Y'Go &+Wfishing&+Y, will ye? Catch two &+Wfish&+Y and bring 'em back to me
&+Yand we'll have us &+Wfish skewers&+Y, eh?!

&+YOr if ye come across a &+Whaunch of land meat&+Y, maybe an &+Wolyx&+Y,&+W lion&+Y,
&+Wtheezak&+Y, &+Wcaribou&+Y, or even just a plain &+Wside of boar&+Y, I'd pay ye!'
~
MA
fishing fish skewer skewers~
&n$n nods hungrily at $N and says &+Y'Ye grow up on em, ye got hooked!'
&N$n lets out a boisterous laugh, causing several patrons to turn
and laugh with her.

&+Y'Bring us back two fish for a skewer, but if they're the same type
&+Yof fish, I always find they come out a bit sizzlier!'&n she says.
~
